</div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8bi5ho" class="W4V2qg comp-le8bi5ho wixui-image" title="Ben Levy"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><wow-image id="img_comp-le8bi5ho" class="Qh0lWW gRkIq0" data-image-info="{&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-le8bi5ho&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;targetWidth&quot;:477,&quot;targetHeight&quot;:318,&quot;isLQIP&quot;:true,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;height&quot;:683,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;11d052_404eacf5282c4c5082185a33e0aa3e9b~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-le8bi5ho" data-bg-effect-name="" data-has-ssr-src="true"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/11d052_404eacf5282c4c5082185a33e0aa3e9b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_119,h_80,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/11d052_404eacf5282c4c5082185a33e0aa3e9b~mv2.jpg" alt="Lavenders" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%" width="477" height="318" loading="lazy"/></wow-image></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8bm6aw" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8bm6aw wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">01</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8bkgbp" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8bkgbp wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span class="color_35 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Lavender</span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8bl0hi" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8bl0hi wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Lavender fields and the song of cicadas perfectly symbolize the magic of Provence.<br>Your wedding memories will remain etched in your mind forever, and what could be more romantic than having your photo taken in the heart of the lavender fields at Domaine de Valbonne?<br><br>Don&#39;t miss this enchanting setting during the famous “golden hour,” when the golden evening light enhances every moment and transforms your wedding photos in Provence into true natural works of art.</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjeg9x" style="display:none"></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-le8bu9lt" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-le8bu9lt wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-le8bu9lt" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-le8bu9lt" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-le8bu9lt" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-le8bu9lt" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-le8bu9ltinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-le8bu9ltinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-le8d1h0a" class="comp-le8d1h0a wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-le8d1h0ainlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-le8d1h0ainlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-le8byznq" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8byznq wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">02</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8bwkqr" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8bwkqr wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span class="color_35 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The shady plain</span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8bxeao" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8bxeao wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">This space surrounded by nature gives free rein to your imagination to create the setting of your dreams.<br>Under the gigantic holm oaks, imagine a secular ceremony full of emotion, a dinner under the stars or in an elegant nomadic tent, or even a brunch the next day in the heart of a natural setting steeped in history.<br>These century-old trees watch over your most precious moments.<br><br>And to prolong the spirit of the south, don&#39;t miss the unmissable pétanque area—a place of typical Provençal conviviality, in the natural shade of the trees or under the guinguette lights at dusk.<br>A joyful and unifying moment, filled with laughter, relaxation, and friendly competition... So, are you shooting or pointing?</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8d0ryy" class="comp-le8d0ryy" data-semantic-classname="button"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com" target="_self" class="StylableButton2545352419__root style-lexabx6p__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="THE GALLERY"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">THE GALLERY</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span><svg data-bbox="13.05 2.55 33.878 54.8" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
    <g>
        <path d="M46.5 28.9L20.6 3c-.6-.6-1.6-.6-2.2 0l-4.8 4.8c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l19.8 20-19.9 19.9c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l4.8 4.8c.6.6 1.6.6 2.2 0l21-21 4.8-4.8c.8-.6.8-1.6.2-2.2z"></path>
    </g>
</svg>
</span></span></span></a></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8bunrx" class="comp-le8bunrx wixui-vector-image"><div data-testid="svgRoot-comp-le8bunrx" class="iL7Pq5 gx51wo"><svg preserveAspectRatio="none" data-bbox="17.3 68.2 165.3 63.6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="17.3 68.2 165.3 63.6" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true">
