t_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span class="color_35 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The clearing</span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8d5zmx1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8d5zmx1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">This natural space is highly prized in Provence for its coolness and unique play of light.<br><br>In the clearing, along the Canet stream, which has been restored to its former glory, you can freely imagine your own decorations and arrangements: a secular ceremony or a country brunch in the shade of century-old oak trees, arbutus trees, or laurels.<br>A peaceful and enchanting setting that leaves no one indifferent.</span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjjvub" style="display:none"></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-le8db595" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-le8db595 wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-le8db595" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-le8db595" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-le8db595" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-le8db595" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-le8db595inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-le8db595inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-le8db5bx" class="comp-le8db5bx wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-le8db5bxinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-le8db5bxinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-le8db5c3" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8db5c3 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">04</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8db5c9" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8db5c9 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span class="color_35 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Pool area</span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8db5cd" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8db5cd wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The cocktail reception or wine reception takes place around the estate&#39;s swimming pool, a 13 x 7 meter heated pool surrounded by spacious terraces, a travertine and wood bar, and elegant lounge areas.<br><br>Located on the elevated part of the Domaine de Valbonne, this space offers your guests a breathtaking view of the historic building and the typical Provencal landscape: vineyards, lavender fields, and olive trees as far as the eye can see.<br>A refined and soothing setting, ideal for a cocktail at sunset or a relaxed brunch.</span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8db5cp" class="comp-le8db5cp wixui-vector-image"><div data-testid="svgRoot-comp-le8db5cp" class="iL7Pq5 gx51wo"><svg preserveAspectRatio="none" data-bbox="17.3 68.2 165.3 63.6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="17.3 68.2 165.3 63.6" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true">
    <g>
        <path d="M182.6 68.2v63.6H17.3V68.2h165.3z"></path>
    </g>
</svg>
