/span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8dkw5r1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-le8dkw5r1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Under the glow of fairy lights, your wedding dinner in Provence will be transformed into a magical evening under the stars, in a friendly and elegant atmosphere.<br><br>And because charm doesn&#39;t depend on the weather, a custom-made canopy can be installed to protect your guests without altering the authentic spirit of the venue.</span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-le8dl7df" class="comp-le8dl7df" data-semantic-classname="button"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com" target="_self" class="StylableButton2545352419__root style-lexachx7__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="THE GALLERY"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">THE GALLERY</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span><svg data-bbox="13.05 2.55 33.878 54.8" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
    <g>
        <path d="M46.5 28.9L20.6 3c-.6-.6-1.6-.6-2.2 0l-4.8 4.8c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l19.8 20-19.9 19.9c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l4.8 4.8c.6.6 1.6.6 2.2 0l21-21 4.8-4.8c.8-.6.8-1.6.2-2.2z"></path>
    </g>
</svg>
</span></span></span></a></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjmudq" style="display:none"></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-lgjjbxak" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-lgjjbxak wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-lgjjbxak" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-lgjjbxak" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-lgjjbxak" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-lgjjbxak" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lgjjbxakinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lgjjbxakinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjbxf6" class="comp-lgjjbxf6 wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-lgjjbxf6inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lgjjbxf6inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjbxfk" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lgjjbxfk wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">04</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjbxg3" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lgjjbxg3 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span class="color_35 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Olive trees</span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjbxg7" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lgjjbxg7 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Organize your intimate wedding ceremony or reception in the heart of the olive groves at Domaine de Valbonne, in a peaceful atmosphere bathed in light.<br>Under the silvery branches of these century-old trees, your guests will enjoy a natural and authentic setting, typical of Provence.<br>Appropriate lighting is essential to enhance this space: luminous skies or curtains of light highlight the trees and create a magical atmosphere once night falls.<br>A place that combines elegance, nature, and conviviality, perfect for prolonging the magic of your wedding in Provence.<br>An iconic tree of the south of France, the olive tree embodies peace, honor, and immortality—symbols that echo the promise of eternal love.</span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjbxga" class="comp-lgjjbxga wixui-vector-image"><div data-testid="svgRoot-comp-lgjjbxga" class="iL7Pq5 gx51wo"><svg preserveAspectRatio="none" data-bbox="17.3 68.2 165.3 63.6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="17.3 68.2 165.3 63.6" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true">
    <g>
        <path d="M182.6 68.2v63.6H17.3V68.2h165.3z"></path>
    </g>
</svg>
</div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjbxgn" class="W4V2qg comp-lgjjbxgn wixui-image" title="Neupap photography"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><wow-image id="img_comp-lgjjbxgn" class="Qh0lWW gRkIq0" data-image-info="{&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-lgjjbxgn&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;targetWidth&quot;:477,&quot;targetHeight&quot;:318,&quot;isLQIP&quot;:true,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;height&quot;:576,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;11d052_82a0346c5c544fda882442cdb4b65803~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;clairiere.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-lgjjbxgn" data-bg-effect-name="" data-has-ssr-src="true"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/11d052_82a0346c5c544fda882442cdb4b65803~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_119,h_67,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/clairiere.jpg" alt="The olive trees" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%" width="477" height="318" loading="lazy"/></wow-image></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjohhi" style="display:none"></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-lf5r1fcb" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-lf5r1fcb wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-lf5r1fcb" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-lf5r1fcb" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-lf5r1fcb" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-lf5r1fcb" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5r1fcbinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5r1fcbinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r1ffb" class="comp-lf5r1ffb wixui-vector-image"><div data-testid="svgRoot-comp-lf5r1ffb" class="iL7Pq5 gx51wo"><svg preserveAspectRatio="none" data-bbox="17.3 6