    </g>
</svg>
</div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r1ffl" class="W4V2qg comp-lf5r1ffl wixui-image" title="Eli Elle"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><wow-image id="img_comp-lf5r1ffl" class="Qh0lWW gRkIq0" data-image-info="{&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-lf5r1ffl&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;targetWidth&quot;:477,&quot;targetHeight&quot;:318,&quot;isLQIP&quot;:true,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:4000,&quot;height&quot;:2667,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;11d052_b2a8bc8ff42f48e7a845655ba7977863~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;20210612Josépha&amp;amp;Alexandre-3469 (1).jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-lf5r1ffl" data-bg-effect-name="" data-has-ssr-src="true"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/11d052_b2a8bc8ff42f48e7a845655ba7977863~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_119,h_80,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/20210612Jos%C3%A9pha%26amp%3BAlexandre-3469%20(1).jpg" alt="The dance hall" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%" width="477" height="318" loading="lazy"/></wow-image></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r1ffo" class="comp-lf5r1ffo wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5r1ffoinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5r1ffoinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r1ffr" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lf5r1ffr wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">05</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r1ffw" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lf5r1ffw wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span class="color_35 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The dance floor</span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r1ffz" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lf5r1ffz wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Opposite the courtyard of the Domaine de Valbonne, a 1,000-square-foot barn, completely renovated and air-conditioned, provides the perfect setting for your dance floor and musical evening, with breathtaking views of olive trees and lavender fields.<br><br>Its blend of stone, glass, and wrought iron, enhanced by sparkling mirror balls and a cozy night bar, creates an elegant and refined party atmosphere, perfect for extending the evening into the night.Let the dancing begin!<br><br>At the entrance to the estate, this magnificent Provençal barn can also be transformed into a charming setting for a secular ceremony or a romantic dinner, offering a sumptuous view of the Provençal countryside.</span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjq8qj" style="display:none"></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-lf5rcz1g" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-lf5rcz1g wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-lf5rcz1g" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-lf5rcz1g" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-lf5rcz1g" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-lf5rcz1g" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5rcz1ginlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5rcz1ginlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5rcz4f" class="comp-lf5rcz4f wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5rcz4finlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5rcz4finlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5rcz4j" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lf5rcz4j wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">04</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5rcz4p" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lf5rcz4p wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span class="color_35 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The vaulted space</span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5rcz4s" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lf5rcz4s wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Facing the courtyard of the Domaine de Valbonne, 1,200 square feet of magnificent vaulted cellars have been completely restored.<br>The charm of exposed stonework, the natural coolness of period walls, and wrought-iron windows create an authentic and intimate atmosphere, enhanced by a bright starry sky that illuminates the vaulted ceiling with a thousand reflections.<br><br>A magical space to host your dinner, ceremony, or cocktail party, even in case of rain or wind.</span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5rcz4v" class="comp-lf5rcz4v wixui-vector-image"><div data-testid="svgRoot-comp-lf5rcz4v" class="iL7Pq5 gx51wo"><svg preserveAspectRatio="none" data-bbox="17.3 68.2 165.3 63.6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="17.3 68.2 165.3 63.6" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true">
    <g>
        <path d="M182.6 68.2v63.6H17.3V68.2h165.3z"></path>
    </g>
</svg>
</div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5rcz51" class="W4V2qg comp-lf5rcz51 wixui-image" title="Valbonne Estate"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><wow-image id="img_comp-lf5rcz51" class="Qh0lWW gRkIq0" data-image-info="{&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-lf5rcz51&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;targetWidth&quot;:477,&quot;targetHeight&quot;:318,&quot;isLQIP&quot;:true,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:6068,&quot;height&quot;:3413,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;11d052_9e6d68d42fdc424db3ef1fb00bbd69df~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;caves.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-lf5rcz51" data-bg-effect-name="" data-has-ssr-src="true"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/11d052_9e6d68d42fdc424db3ef1fb00bbd69df~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_119,h_67,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/caves.jpg" alt="The vaulted space" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%" width="477" height="318" loading="lazy"/></wow-image></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjrv9r" style="display:none"></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-lf5r3k9m" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-lf5r3k9m wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-lf5r3k9m" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-lf5r3k9m" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-lf5r3k9m" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-lf5r3k9m" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5r3k9minlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5r3k9minlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r3kdl" class="comp-lf5r3kdl wixui-vector-image"><div data-testid="svgRoot-comp-lf5r3kdl" class="iL7Pq5 gx51wo"><svg preserveAspectRatio="none" data-bbox="17.3 68.2 165.