    </g>
</svg>
</div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5rg3nm" class="W4V2qg comp-lf5rg3nm wixui-image" title="Valbonne Estate"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><wow-image id="img_comp-lf5rg3nm" class="Qh0lWW gRkIq0" data-image-info="{&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-lf5rg3nm&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;targetWidth&quot;:477,&quot;targetHeight&quot;:318,&quot;isLQIP&quot;:true,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:1494,&quot;height&quot;:1170,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;314229_c5bc6ab27d8b43e3bd4098c5274112b0~mv2.png&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;photoDV-480x306.webp&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-lf5rg3nm" data-bg-effect-name="" data-has-ssr-src="true"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/314229_c5bc6ab27d8b43e3bd4098c5274112b0~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_102,h_80,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/photoDV-480x306.png" alt="The old barn" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%" width="477" height="318" loading="lazy"/></wow-image></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r3kds" class="comp-lf5r3kds wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5r3kdsinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lf5r3kdsinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r3kdv" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lf5r3kdv wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">05</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r3kdy" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lf5r3kdy wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span class="color_35 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">The old barn</span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r3ke1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lf5r3ke1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">At the entrance to the Domaine de Valbonne stands an old Provençal stone barn measuring 90 m², preserved in all its authenticity.<br>Its exposed stonework and wooden beams make it a charming space, ideal for hosting your wedding ceremony, an intimate cocktail party, or a sheltered brunch in case of rain or mistral winds.</span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjurep" style="display:none"></div><!--/$--></div></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="comp-lgjjcijn" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-lgjjcijn wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-lgjjcijn" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-lgjjcijn" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-lgjjcijn" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-lgjjcijn" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-lgjjcijninlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lgjjcijninlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjcimg" class="comp-lgjjcimg wH18kY"><div data-mesh-id="comp-lgjjcimginlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-lgjjcimginlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjcimj" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lgjjcimj wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:20px;"><span style="font-size:20px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-style:italic;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">04</span></span></span></p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjcimm" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lgjjcimm wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:45px;"><span class="color_35 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:45px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:playfair display,serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Pro area</span></span></span></h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjcimo" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL PO9MfV AWXfZq comp-lgjjcimo wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:15px;"><span style="font-size:15px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">At Domaine de Valbonne, we pay particular attention to the satisfaction of your service providers.<br>Because happy teams make for happy newlyweds and guests, we do everything we can to offer them the best working conditions.<br><br>The Domaine has rare, high-end facilities for your caterer and event teams:<br>a large, fully equipped professional kitchen, a cold room, an ice machine, and a 90 m² preparation room where plates can be prepared simultaneously so that all your guests can enjoy smooth service and a perfect dinner.<br><br>Everything is in place to guarantee a successful and delicious wedding reception in the heart of Provence.</span></p></div><!--/$--></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjcimr" class="comp-lgjjcimr wixui-vector-image"><div data-testid="svgRoot-comp-lgjjcimr" class="iL7Pq5 gx51wo"><svg preserveAspectRatio="none" data-bbox="17.3 68.2 165.3 63.6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="17.3 68.2 165.3 63.6" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true">
    <g>
        <path d="M182.6 68.2v63.6H17.3V68.2h165.3z"></path>
    </g>
</svg>
</div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjcimu" class="W4V2qg comp-lgjjcimu wixui-image" title="Domaine de Valbonne"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><wow-image id="img_comp-lgjjcimu" class="Qh0lWW gRkIq0" data-image-info="{&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-lgjjcimu&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;,&quot;targetWidth&quot;:477,&quot;targetHeight&quot;:318,&quot;isLQIP&quot;:true,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:480,&quot;height&quot;:306,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;314229_a5c45102eaad460ca884a26c3a65b78e~mv2.webp&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;caves.jpg&quot;,&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;fill&quot;}}" data-motion-part="BG_IMG comp-lgjjcimu" data-bg-effect-name="" data-has-ssr-src="true"><img src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/314229_a5c45102eaad460ca884a26c3a65b78e~mv2.webp/v1/fill/w_119,h_76,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,blur_2,enc_avif,quality_auto/caves.webp" alt="The professional area" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 50%" width="477" height="318" loading="lazy"/></wow-image></div></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lgjjvsif" style="display:none"></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-lf5r3ke5" class="comp-lf5r3ke5" data-semantic-classname="button"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.domainedevalbonne.com" target="_self" class="StylableButton2545352419__root style-lf5r3ke71__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="THE GALLERY"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">THE GALLERY</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span><svg data-bbox="13.05 2.55 33.878 54.8" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
