#DomaineDeValbonne #englishwedding #britishwedding #destinationweddings #weddingweekend #provencewedding #luxurywedding #frenchweddingvenue #elegantwedding #weddinginprovence #justmarried #britishbride #provence" class="gallery-item-visible gallery-item gallery-item-preloaded" style="width:100%;height:100%" data-hook="gallery-item-image-img" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div></div></div><div data-id="53d25719-b1c7-4df8-ab14-8c51afbf60a4_6" class="item-link-wrapper" data-idx="6" data-hook="item-link-wrapper" tabindex="-1"><div class="gallery-item-container item-container-regular has-custom-focus visible clickable" id="pgi53d25719b1c74df8ab148c51afbf60a4_6_6" data-hash="53d25719-b1c7-4df8-ab14-8c51afbf60a4_6" data-id="53d25719-b1c7-4df8-ab14-8c51afbf60a4_6" data-idx="6" data-hook="item-container" style="overflow-y:hidden;position:absolute;bottom:auto;margin:0;top:660px;left:0;right:auto;width:319px;height:318px;overflow:hidden;transition:opacity .2s ease;opacity:0;display:none"><div data-idx="6" id="item-action-53d25719-b1c7-4df8-ab14-8c51afbf60a4_6" class="item-action" tabindex="-1" data-hook="item-action" aria-label="The estate holds its breath.

Everything is still, for now.

The shadows stretch between the olive trees.

The evening light gently warms the old stone walls.

The pool lies perfectly calm.

Yet in just a few hours, the silence will give way to laughter, embraces, and the joy of reunion.
Tonight, the first guests will arrive at Valbonne for the traditional welcome dinner.

It is one of our favourite moments of the entire wedding weekend.

The moment when families meet, friends who have travelled from afar reconnect, and the celebration truly begins.

Before the ceremony.

Before the party.

Before all the unforgettable moments to come.
Simply the happiness of being together.

Perhaps that is what we love most about hosting wedding weekends: watching a house, a hamlet, a place filled with history slowly come to life and become, for a few days, the backdrop to another family&#x27;s memories.

Wishing our couple and their loved ones a beautiful weekend ahead. 🤍

Estelle &amp; Julien

Domaine de Valbonne, Provence

Photographer @karma.stories.wedding 

