White roses.
Cypress trees.
Endless Provençal hills.

Before the vows.
Before the celebration.
There is this quiet moment —
when you realise you’ve arrived somewhere timeless.

Domaine de Valbonne
Provence, France

Photographer @mariecalfopoulosphotography 

