=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKYhzSpgq6RMSWm3qwMrjnV-KGZTDaf1p7HJiFDD7PivNSJQeT13m2k7Ql0we4oRNiiNImBAMad&oh=00_AQIbkUxLSqVBnxH8NEhgwsJUuKDeFeIW7TjIz33MqKoEDQ&oe=6AAA6BD0"}],"width":218,"height":218},{"type":"carousel","description":"The estate holds its breath.\n\nEverything is still, for now.\n\nThe shadows stretch between the olive trees.\n\nThe evening light gently warms the old stone walls.\n\nThe pool lies perfectly calm.\n\nYet in just a few hours, the silence will give way to laughter, embraces, and the joy of reunion.\nTonight, the first guests will arrive at Valbonne for the traditional welcome dinner.\n\nIt is one of our favourite moments of the entire wedding weekend.\n\nThe moment when families meet, friends who have travelled from afar reconnect, and the celebration truly begins.\n\nBefore the ceremony.\n\nBefore the party.\n\nBefore all the unforgettable moments to come.\nSimply the happiness of being together.\n\nPerhaps that is what we love most about hosting wedding weekends: watching a house, a hamlet, a place filled with history slowly come to life and become, for a few days, the backdrop to another family's memories.\n\nWishing our couple and their loved ones a beautiful weekend ahead. 🤍\n\nEstelle & Julien\n\nDomaine de Valbonne, Provence\n\nPhotographer @karma.stories.wedding \n\n#domainedevalbonne #provencewedding #destinationweddingfrance #weddingweekend #welcomedinner #frenchweddingvenue #southoffrance #provence #luxurywedding #weddinginspiration","alt":"The estate holds its breath.\n\nEverything is still, for now.\n\nThe shadows stretch between the olive trees.\n\nThe evening light gently warms the old stone walls.\n\nThe pool lies perfectly calm.\n\nYet in just a few hours, the silence will give way to laughter, embraces, and the joy of reunion.\nTonight, the first guests will arrive at Valbonne for the traditional welcome dinner.\n\nIt is one of our favourite moments of the entire wedding weekend.\n\nThe moment when families meet, friends who have travelled from afar reconnect, and the celebration truly begins.\n\nBefore the ceremony.\n\nBefore the party.\n\nBefore all the unforgettable moments to come.\nSimply the happiness of being together.\n\nPerhaps that is what we love most about hosting wedding weekends: watching a house, a hamlet, a place filled with history slowly come to life and become, for a few days, the backdrop to another family's memories.\n\nWishing our couple and their loved ones a beautiful weekend ahead. 🤍\n\nEstelle & Julien\n\nDomaine de Valbonne, Provence\n\nPhotographer @karma.stories.wedding \n\n#domainedevalbonne #provencewedding #destinationweddingfrance #weddingweekend #welcomedinner #frenchweddingvenue #southoffrance #provence #luxurywedding #weddinginspiration","src":"https:\/\/instagram.ftlv23-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t51.82787-15\/725191187_18099582476132449_4833805863154984351_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=B1wivhy_2bIQ7kNvwGLsmKd&_nc_oc=AdqzvtQivXSowntOlaclYDeQXtOCT-MMCNKxFN5Fk-OlX3tyl21Mxu4HozZMIW6k00E&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.ftlv23-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQILPY4FttX5jAFThJBvyNOiSeRc4sL05Dswj0pNRhW7Ffa1ckUqYqNn_L0dMbpmliviZPmgqV6l&oh=00_AQJpyLFG8-JlZdhuLH9LKtECtuZ8AqpmYuZ-gOgzVmYYKw&oe=6AAA5317","link":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DZxcaP5iNNI\/","timestamp":"2026-06-19T15:30:35.000Z","children":[{"type":"image","src":"https:\/\/instagram.ftlv23-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t51.82787-15\/725191187_18099582476132449_4833805863154984351_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=B1wivhy_2bIQ7kNvwGLsmKd&_nc_oc=AdqzvtQivXSowntOlaclYDeQXtOCT-MMCNKxFN5Fk-OlX3tyl21Mxu4HozZMIW6k00E&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.ftlv23-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLo_citkXtvHQai8lKPlrwDmqH5tGZD008m09TaUpjb9rHsGnZT_dh42z-gBwL2dzG82LhlZoYx&oh=00_AQL3x-PsZWUNoUvMtFP8I3w2cfRMjqp67uDrFe6WmUo1nQ&oe=6AAA5317"},{"type":"image","src":"https:\/\/instagram.ftlv23-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t51.82787-15\/727444170_18099582464132449_4760859639948478733_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=mgaTG57rqQsQ7kNvwG2o7PY&_nc_oc=AdoagUlxkyCJQiUeValOOYmChVoCRECVD_YdbULGQcveRBbW1f-dj1N0MzLpFXTA0Kc&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.ftlv23-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLMlx37L4dcpEhwnrAJ34VtJmRIZoNClxvL7j1rSFPXn2fxGMPe4gIsiY7IG52q7sAEQjDtR62C&oh=00_AQIIWLjhJ9SAQ0Gj-3WG_EC631t-R-_63AzB7v_cI0CTZQ&oe=6AAA582D"},{"type":"image","src":"https:\/\/instagram.fsdv2-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t51.82787-15\/726061442_18099582467132449_8875115372395173826_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=tADD6Hk_o3MQ7kNvwHlrwtP&_nc_oc=AdphaVbmp6fRt5k4jJV_zMM5BOIsIAClcnVEm_bjYO5fE3dpceWWBXIwLMI8xhhM9lw&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fsdv2-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLhYOZIwpOY86pcUipQZ7xtV1Vfvp5h0KmlxR_HwYEqbOP_BL9q1fNRAC5viber3fGxG6kq7Etz&oh=00_AQLqn_GyUUlGiNNAnFVW82iJtSNpFkzTVBCM9sq41R9d-Q&oe=6AAA5DD5"}],"width":218,"height":218},{"type":"video","description":"When night falls, Valbonne reveals another side\n\nThis winter, at Domaine de Valbonne — a luxury wedding venue in Provence, South of France — we have introduced a multi-meter stone wall designed to redefine the spaces of the estate.\n\nThis new architectural line creates a sense of privacy around the pool and reception areas, while shaping the garden and enhancing the overall flow of your destination wedding in France.\n\nAs evening sets in, the lighting design enhances the historic stone and gently guides your guests through the estate, creating a refined and intimate atmosphere.\n\nAt Valbonne, we create a setting.\nYou create the memories.\n\n🌙 🌙 🌙 \n\nQuand la nuit tombe, Valbonne se révèle autrement\n\nCet hiver, nous avons imaginé et créé un mur de plusieurs mètres au cœur du Domaine de Valbonne, en Provence…\n\nUne nouvelle ligne qui redessine les perspectives, délimite le jardin et crée davantage d’intimité autour de la piscine et des espaces de réception.\n\nÀ la nuit tombée, les mises en lumière viennent sublimer la pierre, structurer les espaces et guider vos invités à travers le domaine, créant une atmosphère chaleureuse et élégante pour vos soirées.\n\nÀ Valbonne, nous créons un cadre.\nVous y créez vos souvenirs.\n\n#provenceweddingvenue\n#luxuryweddingfrance\n#destinationweddingfrance\n#southoffrancewedding\n#frenchweddingvenue","alt":"When night falls, Valbonne reveals another side\n\nThis winter, at Domaine de Valbonne — a luxury wedding venue in Provence, South of France — we have introduced a multi-meter stone wall designed to redefine the spaces of the estate.\n\nThis new architectural line creates a sense of privacy around the pool and reception areas, while shaping the garden and enhancing the overall flow of your destination wedding in France.\n\nAs evening sets in, the lighting design enhances the historic stone and gently guides your guests through the estate, creating a refined and intimate atmosphere.\n\nAt Valbonne, we create a setting.\nYou create the memories.\n\n🌙 🌙 🌙 \n\nQuand la nuit tombe, Valbonne se révèle autrement\n\nCet hiver, nous avons imaginé et créé un mur de plusieurs mètres au cœur du Domaine de Valbonne, en Provence…\n\nUne nouvelle ligne qui redessine les perspectives, délimite le jardin et crée davantage d’intimité autour de la piscine et des espaces de réception.\n\nÀ la nuit tombée, les mises en lumière viennent sublimer la pierre, structurer les espaces et guider vos invités à travers le domaine, créant une atmosphère chaleureuse et élégante pour vos soirées.\n\nÀ Valbonne, nous créons un cadre.\nVous y créez vos souvenirs.\n\n#provenceweddingvenue\n#luxuryweddingfrance\n#destinationweddingfrance\n#southoffrancewedding\n#frenchweddingvenue","src":"https:\/\/instagram.ftlv23-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/o1\/v\/t2\/f2\/m86\/AQOIcss_kBCFiLldRXFpYVVIoHiT544J415atPQHG8nCGcZZ53xghSA4HFHU6dd7umUE411E0iYTY3IwVSL1Unr4UAbO4JVqqgvQowQ.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdqRy_t7MDADXc9AAKhjxSLrTUuub7RXSyQhjsIeinkL2z_x8nvHywlnK3_7dqPKnCg&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.ftlv23-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=BbMEwqwpsN4Q7kNvwEiY4nw&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTgwOTQ0MDIxOTMxMzI0NDksImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoxMzUsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoxNSwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=b4148d1dbe9635fe&_nc_&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_zt=28&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLyq71k4rNDJ3MmxrTLCttsswTz1DNYwVnt3H_FVIh5uGvYoKZxF_qxrnLjaXTqPiAmUUF_VS0b&oh=00_AQItkQ3u_3mnKZ2tN3aa9cAFO2brcKxENEbVUNrSqUkUWA&oe=6AA65ACF","thumbnail":"https:\/\/instagram.fsdv2-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t51.71878-15\/684243762_1271521444628217_4590095866783681699_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=vkj4gwyz0moQ7kNvwH7-16c&_nc_oc=Ado29umDIzoPI7HNfG-m2lQA9FSqSbIlOTm4yAqXZO1jInLGH_2kMBPhD8_YbvxgjEI&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fsdv2-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJbwhS7VMu_fqqszzWGufV1hQTwsV4eikaAVII1qWOuXj3s2Fs77M2DNI36IquQU7siPzuUjmdL&oh=00_AQIoxuTWIzd4zrvOid-MHlTCiNayxVaBinK7_B1KJLcuTA&oe=6AAA645B","link":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/reel\/DXuMPXFiADA\/","timestamp":"2026-04-29T16:26:54.000Z","width":218,"height":218},{"type":"carousel","description":"Dinner under the olive trees.\n\nAs the sun sets over the grove, long tables come to life with soft lights, flowers and the scent of Provence.\n\nOne of the most magical moments of a wedding day.\n\nMade possible thanks to an incredible team of wedding planners who bring these celebrations to life.\n\nPhotographer : @zephyrkok \n\nWedding Planner: @melissawilpotte @mw.paca \nWedding Planner’s assistant: @mw.gironde @mw_normandie @mw.occitanie \nPlace: @domainedevalbonne \nFloral & Wedding Designer: @lindachampenoisdesign \nTableware: @options_aixenprovence \nFurnitures: @jolibazaar \nStarry sky structure: @be_lounge_officiel \n\n#provencewedding \n#olivegrovewedding \n#dinnerundertheolivetrees \n#provenceweddingvenue \n#destinationweddingfrance \n#weddinginprovence \n#southoffrancewedding \n#luxuryweddingfrance \n#frenchweddingvenue \n#provencevenue","alt":"Dinner under the olive trees.\n\nAs the sun sets over the grove, long tables come to life with soft lights, flowers and the scent of Provence.\n\nOne of the most magical moments of a wedding day.\n\nMade possible thanks to an incredible team of wedding planners who bring these celebrations to life.\n\nPhotographer : @zephyrkok \n\nWedding Planner: @melissawilpotte @mw.paca \nWedding Planner’s assistant: @mw.gironde @mw_normandie @mw.occitanie \nPlace: @domainedevalbonne \nFloral & Wedding Designer: @lindachampenoisdesign \nTableware: @options_aixenprovence \nFurnitures: @jolibazaar \nStarry sky structure: @be_lounge_officiel \n\n#provencewedding \n#olivegrovewedding \n#dinnerundertheolivetrees \n#provenceweddingvenue \n#destinationweddingfrance \n#weddinginprovence \n#southoffrancewedding \n#luxuryweddingfrance \n#frenchweddingvenue \n#provencevenue","src":"https:\/\/instagram.fsdv2-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t51.82787-15\/652042016_18089837672132449_6611621246650073685_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=cBXd64g3sDkQ7kNvwG2I_u_&_nc_oc=Adpqho1jXM-2a8-hzwj5L1tgGM_DdCZHb4yQ38RcnMthvYT0Ra84AnDZdg9vVEA15qg&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fsdv2-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKfYfb0_5X2bdIXnJSvDIjmRNvdGkXFYlZs7xgew5Kvc4dUXOn3b34ttV2MnKmUds7DBRtLzDqU&oh=00_AQLrV74VzX