fg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=XFlU2OJgiUEQ7kNvwF4a4eT&_nc_oc=Adqu7jaIWbmRueuPtJ7aDawO7Rqkv7dpsVq-R2Jejiy_u39RDvr08tN2aN9q4TOFEG8&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fsdv2-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLm3XT0uwd_SfN6o10v5tCIO7VpA6YlQVnYidAoLPBPBvGxhCVEqA-SwCSRXTo8rsj17wmZX0eu&oh=00_AQIECSoHO5aaLz1A9K53zXISvQ6bPgzjg2buR92QEbTBMQ&oe=6AAA6870"},{"type":"image","src":"https:\/\/instagram.ftlv23-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t51.82787-15\/625993837_18085811039132449_2780230562231506413_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=nl1hm4ONfm0Q7kNvwHbHsSC&_nc_oc=Adr4ssABHMwa3B8Fm2tM9Kddobtoa1fS-JLezyZ1p5rb6_2EUJtW_WptUF5F1Usxnzo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.ftlv23-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKH7_vTsi0zq4gJY324vrJYzmyvadwWlmeb2HVf96DdfL4bjSQzRcsvSNGWN_KXdtuU76jSCl25&oh=00_AQIy7hPiG_5itfx533XrPFBAutTg4I7JU-fuWF2gY09r2w&oe=6AAA6179"},{"type":"image","src":"https:\/\/instagram.ftlv23-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t51.82787-15\/625082057_18085811003132449_25590457914351879_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=aYSyFYdmVZ8Q7kNvwE7_O8S&_nc_oc=Adp8KBrqqBwZ8ieQ4Pnwd2XDHl7mYHLLYeeZ647M4-weUyf1t0txhfYYaQ4FiuzLQCo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.ftlv23-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJ3CAP4lPfgPhr3tS9ZGMLyJSJ_2GlSOqjARsDgOXPgGlXbLncKVdJFTCSuaHbuKIUR73fBLTnY&oh=00_AQLi8yWrkJbyaLXRiY5wpwaI7yljoTHUtR5yK43cLTO7eQ&oe=6AAA4B18"}],"width":218,"height":218},{"type":"carousel","description":"At our place, people arrive on Friday.\nThey unpack their bags, settle in,\nand the hamlet slowly comes to life.\n\nSaturday brings the energy, the celebration, the reunions.\n\nAnd then there is Sunday evening.\n\nFewer people remain.\nWe’re tired, but in a good way.\nConversations last longer, feel more real.\n\nThat’s often when emotions run the deepest.\nNot because something spectacular is happening, but because there’s nothing left to prove.\n\nThat’s why we host weddings from Friday to Monday.\n\nBecause the Domaine isn’t a place to rent.\nIt’s a small hamlet to live in.\n\n📸 Photographer: @clarisseetjohan\n\nChez nous, les gens arrivent le vendredi.\nIls posent leurs valises, prennent leurs marques, et le hameau commence doucement à vivre.\n\nLe samedi, il y a l’énergie, la fête, les retrouvailles.\n\nEt puis il y a le dimanche soir.\n\nIl reste moins de monde...\nOn est fatigués, mais bien.\nLes discussions sont plus longues, plus vraies.\n\nC’est souvent là que les émotions sont les plus fortes.\nPas parce qu’il se passe quelque chose de spectaculaire, mais justement parce que plus rien n’est à prouver.\n\nC’est pour ça qu’ici, on accueille les mariages du vendredi au lundi.\n\nParce que le Domaine, ce n’est pas un lieu à louer. C’est un petit hameau à habiter.\n\nPhotographe @clarisseetjohan \n\n#domainevalbonne \n#weddinghamlet \n#destinationweddingfrance \n#provencestylewedding \n#villagelife \n#slowwedding \n#authenticwedding \n#provencewedding \n#weekendwedding","alt":"At our place, people arrive on Friday.\nThey unpack their bags, settle in,\nand the hamlet slowly comes to life.\n\nSaturday brings the energy, the celebration, the reunions.\n\nAnd then there is Sunday evening.\n\nFewer people remain.\nWe’re tired, but in a good way.\nConversations last longer, feel more real.\n\nThat’s often when emotions run the deepest.\nNot because something spectacular is happening, but because there’s nothing left to prove.\n\nThat’s why we host weddings from Friday to Monday.\n\nBecause the Domaine isn’t a place to rent.\nIt’s a small hamlet to live in.\n\n📸 Photographer: @clarisseetjohan\n\nChez nous, les gens arrivent le vendredi.\nIls posent leurs valises, prennent leurs marques, et le hameau commence doucement à vivre.\n\nLe samedi, il y a l’énergie, la fête, les retrouvailles.\n\nEt puis il y a le dimanche soir.\n\nIl reste moins de monde...\nOn est fatigués, mais bien.\nLes discussions sont plus longues, plus vraies.\n\nC’est souvent là que les émotions sont les plus fortes.\nPas parce qu’il se passe quelque chose de spectaculaire, mais justement parce que plus rien n’est à prouver.\n\nC’est pour ça qu’ici, on accueille les mariages du vendredi au lundi.\n\nParce que le Domaine, ce n’est pas un lieu à louer. C’est un petit hameau à habiter.\n\nPhotographe @clarisseetjohan \n\n#domainevalbonne \n#weddinghamlet \n#destinationweddingfrance \n#provencestylewedding \n#villagelife \n#slowwedding \n#authenticwedding \n#provencewedding \n#weekendwedding","src":"https:\/\/instagram.fsdv2-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t51.82787-15\/611256810_18083297129132449_5711576885268090684_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=v6T7zDWItXcQ7kNvwEAzEwL&_nc_oc=AdqL1ybLjzlI-6Q_9LPAp1UHFtbeptWdHvZZ6jzEG0CqM5a9Kyb1Sxd0ccv2m76QzOQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fsdv2-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJeyhQfiK2zVQ0YwHoPe5B8H2WYhgoRXVOVmZ-2rnCcZKp2KGhAZZLbpKNgKmhItsG0rOn9saI6&oh=00_AQJEacyQPMHK3VgCUgdJfz5jNCPjiFfswpP8EYigfqFTWA&oe=6AAA496D","link":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DTN4-iWiNPO\/","timestamp":"2026-01-07T16:59:11.000Z","children":[{"type":"image","src":"https:\/\/instagram.fsdv2-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/v\/t51.82787-15\/611256810_18083297129132449_5711576885268090684_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=v6T7zDWItXcQ7kNvwEAzEwL&_nc_oc=AdqL1ybLjzlI-6Q_9LPAp1UHFtbeptWdHvZZ6jzEG0CqM5a9Kyb1Sxd0ccv2m76QzOQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fsdv2-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLbdJo5xPyOCeeyo3oAAEotSS0rheAFmEUQdUK_gUiyeP9phcnWDx_GscwIiLTUVt3Y5Up9bShN&oh=00_AQLCVzspAxDc2ov_Dtoyy2EsjEklwO-r2XAI