87-15\/610174427_18082774310132449_3274836036258058688_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=YOjZF7ZQkwoQ7kNvwHLLn16&_nc_oc=AdpWGri5nHqjWvfYrklqUlz5nsz1V4cYoUCdmXInLWd0MLzIfrFI_l13vWHNw3gBeAA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.ftlv23-1.fna&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=Sr1fiQKatDeYfrPUmA3DGw&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLjLx8DBFyKBNutilctSmkubzqJygFaj2fV-cVnPiRMDSjrBWu8wf8FHs1DhcswRm3XCMfDgvRn&oh=00_AQIRzBIJKRmDX-cdo3HAJ8DO7bLF7hiAMg8uxgIBbtcj1g&oe=6AAA392A"}],"width":218,"height":218},{"type":"carousel","description":"A chic and vibrant June wedding at Domaine de Valbonne ✨\nL&A, two globe-trotters with effortless style, created a colourful and joyful celebration filled with energy, elegance and modern romance.\nSurrounded by an exceptional team:\n\nPhotography: @beige_mariages \nMakeup Artist: @alwinenogier \nFlowers: @audreyvkbfleuriste \nDJ: @33tours.dj \nCatering: @le_traiteur_par_la_boria \nVenue: @domainedevalbonne \n\nA radiant, refined and unforgettable wedding in the heart of Provence 💛\n\n#provencewedding #provenceweddingvenue #southoffrancewedding #destinationweddingfrance #weddinginprovence #provenceweddingplanner #frenchweddingvenue #luxuryweddingvenue #domainedevalbonne #weddingvenueprovence #provencebride #provenceweddingphotographer #provencevibes #frenchwedding #lavenderfieldsfrance #vauclusewedding #dromeprovencale #southoffrancebride #elegantwedding #colorfulwedding #weddinginspiration #globetrottercouple #romanticwedding #summerwedding","alt":"A chic and vibrant June wedding at Domaine de Valbonne ✨\nL&A, two globe-trotters with effortless style, created a colourful and joyful celebration filled with energy, elegance and modern romance.\nSurrounded by an exceptional team:\n\nPhotography: @beige_mariages \nMakeup Artist: @alwinenogier \nFlowers: @audreyvkbfleuriste \nDJ: @33tours.dj \nCatering: @le_traiteur_par_la_boria \nVenue: @domainedevalbonne \n\nA radiant, refined and u